battalion-entity 1
id explosion-standard
display-name Standard Explosion
description Data-driven outward particle burst used by impact and destruction components.
kind effect
editor-placeable no
placement none
render-style particle-burst
particle-start-color white
particle-middle-color orange
particle-end-color red-3
particle-count 32
